@startuml
title 角色与功能用例图
left to right direction

actor "来宾" as Guest
actor "学校接待人员" as Reception
actor "酒店工作人员" as Hotel
actor "平台管理员\n即学校管理员" as Admin

rectangle "学校来宾酒店预订系统" {
  package "来宾服务" {
    usecase "查看本人住宿安排" as ViewStay
  }
  package "接待业务" {
    usecase "录入住宿需求" as Demand
    usecase "查询与推荐酒店" as Search
    usecase "确认方案并自动预订" as Book
    usecase "展示适用费用规则" as ShowRule
    usecase "查询请求处理结果" as Result
    usecase "改订与整单取消" as Change
    usecase "确认续住及核对额外费用" as Extend
    usecase "选择并确认停业替代方案" as Relocate
  }
  package "酒店业务" {
    usecase "维护房型、价格与学校名额" as Inventory
    usecase "逐人入住与补登记" as Checkin
    usecase "正常及提前退房登记" as Checkout
    usecase "提出续住及额外费用" as ProposeExtend
    usecase "记录晚到保留及登记未入住" as NoShow
    usecase "确认停业及影响范围" as Closure
    usecase "确认截止后的特殊改订" as Special
  }
  package "管理与监督" {
    usecase "管理账号与酒店资料" as Accounts
    usecase "维护地点、距离及审核评价" as Quality
    usecase "配置约定费用规则" as Rules
    usecase "处理费用争议及通知失败项" as Exception
    usecase "按权限查看统计报表" as Report
    usecase "按权限查询操作日志" as Audit
    usecase "查看相关通知" as Notice
  }
}

Guest -- ViewStay
Reception -- Demand
Reception -- Search
Reception -- Book
Reception -- Result
Reception -- Change
Reception -- Extend
Reception -- Relocate
Reception -- Report
Reception -- Notice
Hotel -- Inventory
Hotel -- Checkin
Hotel -- Checkout
Hotel -- NoShow
Hotel -- Closure
Hotel -- Special
Hotel -- ProposeExtend
Hotel -- Report
Hotel -- Audit
Hotel -- Notice
Admin -- Accounts
Admin -- Quality
Admin -- Rules
Admin -- Exception
Admin -- Special
Admin -- Report
Admin -- Audit
Admin -- Notice
Book ..> ShowRule : <<include>>

legend bottom
  来宾只看本人安排及脱敏电话；接待人员限负责范围；酒店限本酒店。
  普通预订自动确认，无酒店审批；来宾不自行订房。
  入住前一日18:00整起，特殊改订须管理员及酒店均确认并留痕，
  随后由负责接待人员确认新方案及差额；原单仍须处于已确认。
endlegend
@enduml
